{"seq":3,"slug":"animation-transitions","title":"动画与过渡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-visualization/interaction/animation-transitions","wordCount":1709,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"动画与过渡\">动画与过渡</h1><p>把柱状图从「今年数据」切换到「去年数据」，如果柱子瞬间跳变，读者会瞬间迷失：哪根柱子变高了？哪根消失了？哪根是新增的？而如果柱子平滑地伸缩、移动、淡入淡出，读者的眼睛能一路跟住每根柱子的变化，认知负荷骤降。这就是可视化动画的真正职责——它不是给图表加点炫酷的装饰，而是帮人类视觉系统维持「物体恒存」的追踪，让数据的变化变得可读。但动画也是性能与可访问性的双重雷区，用错了比不用还糟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可视化里的动画几乎都是过渡（transition）：从一个状态平滑地变到另一个状态。它的机制是补间（tweening）——给定起始值和结束值，在一段时间内按某条缓动曲线插值出中间帧。三个要素决定一次过渡：插值（怎么算中间值）、缓动（变化的快慢节奏）、对象恒等（哪个旧元素对应哪个新元素）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[状态 A 旧数据] --&gt; B[计算差异&lt;br/&gt;enter update exit]&#10;  B --&gt; C[对象恒等匹配&lt;br/&gt;key 函数对应新旧元素]&#10;  C --&gt; D[补间插值&lt;br/&gt;起始值到结束值]&#10;  D --&gt; E[缓动函数&lt;br/&gt;线性 ease 弹性]&#10;  E --&gt; F[逐帧渲染&lt;br/&gt;requestAnimationFrame]&#10;  F --&gt; G[状态 B 新数据]&#10;  B --&gt; H[enter 元素淡入&lt;br/&gt;exit 元素淡出]&#10;  H --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[状态 A 旧数据] --&gt; B[计算差异&lt;br/&gt;enter update exit]\n  B --&gt; C[对象恒等匹配&lt;br/&gt;key 函数对应新旧元素]\n  C --&gt; D[补间插值&lt;br/&gt;起始值到结束值]\n  D --&gt; E[缓动函数&lt;br/&gt;线性 ease 弹性]\n  E --&gt; F[逐帧渲染&lt;br/&gt;requestAnimationFrame]\n  F --&gt; G[状态 B 新数据]\n  B --&gt; H[enter 元素淡入&lt;br/&gt;exit 元素淡出]\n  H --&gt; F</pre><p>动画在可视化里的几种功能性用途，要与纯装饰区分开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动画类型</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>是否必要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态过渡</td>\n<td>维持物体恒存追踪</td>\n<td>数据更新时柱子伸缩</td>\n<td>高价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进入/退出</td>\n<td>标示数据增减</td>\n<td>新点淡入、删点淡出</td>\n<td>高价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩放过渡</td>\n<td>保持空间连续性</td>\n<td>地图缩放平滑</td>\n<td>高价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引导注意</td>\n<td>高亮关键变化</td>\n<td>异常点脉冲闪烁</td>\n<td>适度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加载动画</td>\n<td>填补等待</td>\n<td>入场逐条绘制</td>\n<td>慎用，别拖慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯装饰</td>\n<td>无信息价值</td>\n<td>无意义的旋转弹跳</td>\n<td>避免</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"补间与缓动的数学\">补间与缓动的数学</h2><p>补间的核心是插值函数。对一个从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的数值，在归一化进度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\in [0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 处的值是线性插值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(t) = a + (b - a) \\cdot t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 本身很少直接用线性时间。直接用线性时间的动画看起来很「机械」，因为现实世界的运动都有加减速。缓动函数（easing）就是把线性的时间进度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 重映射成非线性的进度。最常用的 ease-in-out 让动画开始慢、中间快、结尾慢，更符合物理直觉。一个常见的缓动是三次方 ease-out：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e(t) = 1 - (1 - t)^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它让动画快速启动、缓缓收尾，给人「迅速响应又平稳落定」的感觉。颜色和路径也能补间——颜色在合适的色彩空间里逐通道插值（呼应 <a href=\"../foundations/perception-color\">感知、颜色与可读性</a> 讲的色彩空间），路径形状则在对应点之间插值坐标。</p>\n<p>动画的驱动器是 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code>，它在浏览器每次重绘前回调，自动对齐到屏幕刷新节奏。每帧根据已过时间算出当前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，求出插值，更新元素，下一帧继续，直到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 到 1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对象恒等-过渡的灵魂\">对象恒等：过渡的灵魂</h2><p>过渡能不能「认得出谁是谁」，全靠对象恒等。这正是 <a href=\"../rendering/d3-low-level\">D3.js 与底层可视化</a> 里 key 函数的用武之地：数据更新时，D3 用 key 函数判断哪个新数据对应哪个旧元素，于是同一个数据项对应的柱子会从旧位置平滑移动到新位置，而不是被错配成另一根。</p>\n<p>没有正确的对象恒等，过渡会产生荒诞的视觉效果：数据重新排序后，元素按数组索引匹配，会让「A 柱」的动画终点落在「B 柱」的位置，柱子之间互相穿插滑动，完全误导读者。这把 <a href=\"../foundations/visual-encoding-principles\">视觉编码与图形语法</a> 的表达力原则推到了时间维度——动画也必须只表达数据中真实发生的变化（这根柱子真的从 30 涨到了 50），而不能捏造不存在的运动。</p>\n<p>进入和退出的元素需要特殊处理。新增的数据项（enter）通常从「不存在」状态淡入或从零高度长出；被删除的数据项（exit）淡出或缩回零再移除。这与 <a href=\"../rendering/d3-low-level\">D3.js 与底层可视化</a> 的 enter/update/exit 三选区一一对应，过渡只是给每个选区配上各自的动画。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能-动画最容易拖垮帧率\">性能：动画最容易拖垮帧率</h2><p>动画是 <a href=\"large-data-performance\">大数据量渲染与性能</a> 讲的帧预算的最大消耗者——它要求连续多帧都在 16.7 毫秒内完成重渲染，任何一帧超支都会卡顿，而卡顿的动画比没有动画更让人难受。几条守则。</p>\n<p>第一，能用 CSS/SVG 的合成属性就别用 JS 逐帧改。<code>transform</code> 和 <code>opacity</code> 的动画可以由浏览器在合成线程上跑、不触发布局重排，性能最好；而动画 <code>width</code>、<code>height</code>、<code>top</code> 会触发每帧重排，代价高昂。第二，大数据量时不要给每个元素都加过渡——给十万个点同时做补间会瞬间炸掉帧预算，应当只动画聚合后的少量元素，或干脆禁用过渡直接切换。第三，过渡时长要克制，通常 200 到 500 毫秒，太长会让用户觉得界面迟钝。Canvas/WebGL 的动画则要自己用 requestAnimationFrame 管理逐帧重绘，并复用 <a href=\"large-data-performance\">大数据量渲染与性能</a> 的分层与批渲染手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可访问性-尊重减少动效偏好\">可访问性：尊重减少动效偏好</h2><p>动画对部分用户不仅无益，甚至有害：前庭功能障碍者可能因大幅运动产生眩晕和不适。操作系统提供了「减少动效」（reduce motion）的无障碍设置，浏览器通过 <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> 媒体查询暴露它。负责任的图表必须尊重这个偏好——检测到用户开启了减少动效，就关闭非必要的过渡，改用瞬时切换或极短的淡变。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {&#10;  .chart * {&#10;    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@media</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .chart</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transition-duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这并非可有可无的细节，而是 <a href=\"../practice/accessible-responsive-charts\">可访问与响应式图表</a> 所讲无障碍责任的一部分。动画的功能性价值（帮人追踪变化）和它的潜在伤害（眩晕）必须放在一起权衡：默认提供平滑过渡帮助多数人，但永远给出尊重偏好的退路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可视化动画的功能是维持「物体恒存」追踪，帮人读懂数据变化，而非装饰；纯装饰动画应避免。</li>\n<li>过渡靠补间实现：在起止值间按缓动曲线插值，线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(t)=a+(b-a)t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 配非线性缓动更自然。</li>\n<li>对象恒等（key 函数）是过渡的灵魂，错配会让元素互相穿插、误导读者，把表达力原则推到时间维度。</li>\n<li>enter/update/exit 三选区各配淡入、移动、淡出动画，与 <a href=\"../rendering/d3-low-level\">D3.js 与底层可视化</a> 的数据连接一一对应。</li>\n<li>动画是帧预算最大消耗者：优先用 transform/opacity 合成属性，大数据量别逐元素补间，时长控制在 200–500ms。</li>\n<li>必须尊重 <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>，为前庭障碍用户关闭非必要动效，这是 <a href=\"../practice/accessible-responsive-charts\">可访问与响应式图表</a> 无障碍责任的一部分。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动画与过渡","id":"动画与过渡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"补间与缓动的数学","id":"补间与缓动的数学"},{"level":2,"text":"对象恒等：过渡的灵魂","id":"对象恒等-过渡的灵魂"},{"level":2,"text":"性能：动画最容易拖垮帧率","id":"性能-动画最容易拖垮帧率"},{"level":2,"text":"可访问性：尊重减少动效偏好","id":"可访问性-尊重减少动效偏好"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大数据量渲染与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-visualization/interaction/large-data-performance"},"next":{"title":"仪表盘架构与组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-visualization/practice/dashboard-architecture"}}